#: ../../source/notebooks/18. 90ddc2c826144c6db9885e102652c804 Dynamic
#: Selection.ipynb:9 Symbol
msgid "Dynamic Symbol Selection"
msgstr "动态品种选择"

#: ../../source/notebooks/18. 5039ca167cb843d6bd127d80b3fea056 Dynamic
#: Selection.ipynb:11 Symbol
msgid ""
"Every strategy so far has traded a fixed list of ticker symbols chosen "
"before the backtest began. Instead, we may want a strategy to target "
"whichever symbols look best right now. These could be the most liquid "
"names, or the ones with the highest momentum or value."
msgstr ""
"到目前为止，每个策略交易的都是在回测开始前就已选定的固定股票代码列表。而我们有时希望策略能够瞄准当下表现最好的品种，"
"例如流动性最高的品种，或者动量或价值最高的品种。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/18. 519ce2d777b24f74904521335c965f08 Dynamic
#: Selection.ipynb:13 Symbol
msgid ""
"**PyBroker v2** supports dynamic symbol selection with a `SymbolSelector "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.SymbolSelector>`__,"
" as shown in this notebook."
msgstr ""
"**PyBroker v2** 通过 `SymbolSelector "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.SymbolSelector>`__"
" 支持动态品种选择，本文档将对此进行演示。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/18. 0039adf603294669959348bd3757b58e Dynamic
#: Selection.ipynb:25 Symbol
msgid "Loading the Candidate Universe"
msgstr "加载候选品种池"

