msgid ""
"The example below ranks the universe by average dollar volume and keeps "
"the top three symbols:"
msgstr "下面的示例按平均成交额对品种池进行排名，并保留排名前三的品种："

#: ../../source/notebooks/18. 763d4c81c1144b8a98092358602512e0 Dynamic
#: Selection.ipynb:353 Symbol
msgid "Running the Strategy"
msgstr "运行策略"

#: ../../source/notebooks/18. Dynamic Selection.ipynb:355 Symbol
#: c8bf15171a974ddeb924137c60f7c961
msgid ""
"The example below implements a simple breakout strategy. It buys when a "
"symbol closes above its previous 20-day high, calculated using `highv "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.vect.html#pybroker.vect.highv>`__,"
" and it sells when the symbol closes below its previous 20-day low, "
"calculated using `lowv "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.vect.html#pybroker.vect.lowv>`__."
" Those values are registered as `indicators "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.indicator>`__"
" and read in the execution with `ctx.indicator "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.indicator>`__."
" The strategy splits capital equally across the top three selected stocks"
" with `set_target_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.set_target_shares>`__,"
" and exits with `sell_all_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.sell_all_shares>`__:"
msgstr ""
"下面的示例实现了一个简单的突破策略：当某品种收盘价高于其此前 20 日高点（使用 `highv "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.vect.html#pybroker.vect.highv>`__"
" 计算）时买入，当收盘价低于其此前 20 日低点（使用 `lowv "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.vect.html#pybroker.vect.lowv>`__"
" 计算）时卖出。这些数值被注册为 `indicators "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.indicator>`__，"
"并在执行函数中通过 `ctx.indicator "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.indicator>`__"
" 读取。该策略使用 `set_target_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.set_target_shares>`__"
" 将资金平均分配到所选的前三只股票上，并使用 `sell_all_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.sell_all_shares>`__"
" 平仓："

#: ../../source/notebooks/18. Dynamic Selection.ipynb:397 Symbol
#: af63eebdd52a4935937d10b0319b35db
msgid ""
"For each `walkforward "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`__"
" window, the ``top_dollar_volume`` selector runs on the train split and "
"selects the top three stocks to trade in the subsequent test split:"
msgstr ""
"对于每个 `walkforward "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`__"
" 窗口，``top_dollar_volume`` 选择器会在训练集划分上运行，并选出排名前三的股票，用于在后续的测试集划分中进行交易："
